      "label": "s2_side02_0030_camera_04",
      "hash64": "9180AA077DC9A18D",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Wha—?! [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. That Pokémon.\\nIsn’t\\r\\nthat\\r\\nthe\\r\\nPokémon\\r\\nfrom\\r\\nthe\\r\\npicture?![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
