      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s2_side02_0030_camera_12",
      "hash64": "917D22077DC6849E",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]You keep running, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\nFind\\r\\nunknown\\r\\nPokémon,\\r\\nhave\\r\\ngrand\\r\\nadventures...\\r\\nDo\\r\\nit\\r\\nfor me![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
