      "label": "s2_side02_0030_camera_npc_01",
      "hash64": "A487FFC5BD0B7C06",
      "text": "They keep adding more and more functions to\\nthese camera apps, you know?\\c\\nAs a photographer, I guess I’ve gotta be able to\\nuse filters and all that to stay cool, huh?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
